# 22.5 Constraints

## Primary Key

```sql
PRIMARY KEY (id);
```

---

## Foreign Key

```sql
FOREIGN KEY (profile_id)

REFERENCES profiles(id)

ON DELETE CASCADE;
```

Each preference record is automatically removed if its parent profile is deleted.

---

## Unique Constraint

Each user may have only one preference record.

```sql
UNIQUE(profile_id);
```

---

## Check Constraints

```sql
CHECK(theme IN ('light','dark'));
```

---

```sql
CHECK(default_homepage IN ('home','documents','chat','insights'));
```

