# 22.8 Preference Management

User preferences allow every KnowledgeOS workspace to be personalized without affecting other users.

Whenever a preference is updated, the changes take effect immediately and are automatically reflected across the application.

Example:

```text
User Changes Theme

↓

Update user_preferences

↓

Frontend Receives New Preference

↓

UI Updates Instantly
```

Preferences remain persistent across sessions and devices.

