# 23. Table — Insights

---

# 23.1 Purpose

The `insights` table stores AI-generated observations, summaries, and personalized knowledge intelligence derived from a user's uploaded documents and conversations.

Unlike chat messages, which are generated in response to explicit user queries, insights are proactively generated by background AI agents to help users better understand, organize, and connect their knowledge.

Insights represent one of the core differentiators of KnowledgeOS by transforming isolated information into actionable intelligence.

Each insight belongs exclusively to one authenticated user.

---

# 23.2 Relationships

```text
profiles

│

│ 1 : N

▼

insights
```

A user may own multiple insights.

Each insight belongs to exactly one profile.

Insights are generated using one or more uploaded documents and may optionally reference one or more chat sessions.

---

# 23.3 Insight Generation Pipeline

```text
Documents

+

Chat History

↓

Knowledge Retrieval

↓

Knowledge Synthesis

↓

Insight Generator

↓

Reviewer Agent

↓

Insight Saved

↓

Displayed on Dashboard
```

Insights are generated asynchronously and never block normal user interactions.

