# 23.13 Summary

The `insights` table represents the intelligence layer of KnowledgeOS.

Unlike traditional AI assistants that respond only when prompted, KnowledgeOS proactively generates personalized knowledge insights by synthesizing information across documents and conversations.

This architecture enables users to discover hidden relationships, identify knowledge gaps, monitor learning progress, and receive AI-driven recommendations while maintaining complete source traceability and user-specific data isolation.

